{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmgqYgdebw1M7FQyBZ8j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I think I'll leave it, at least for now. Ask me again once I've talked it over with you. I'm fairly sure about that, and the reason is simple. This page is about buying shares and funds. I didn't see one word about deposits or anything safe like what I have at the bank. To open an account they want at least 10,000 ₪. The charges looked small, but I couldn't tell what they would come to in shekels.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **The top.** \"פסגות ניירות ערך (פסגות טרייד)\", \"בית השקעות, חבר בורסה שאינו בנק\". So it's not a bank. I know the name Psagot, but not as a bank.\n- **The charges (\"העמלות\"):**\n  - Buying and selling (\"עמלת קנייה ומכירה\"): 0.07%, at least 2 ₪ each time.\n  - Looking after the securities (\"דמי ניהול פיקדון ניירות ערך\"): 0.03% \"לרבעון\". The word פיקדון caught my eye, but it isn't a deposit like mine.\n  - A fixed account charge (\"דמי חשבון קבועים\"): 0.00 ₪ a month. That part was nice to see.\n- **Changing money (\"המרת מטבע\").** It's written twice. First it says \"1.5 אגורות לדולר\", then a bit lower down \"0.5%\". Which one is it?\n- **\"מה אפשר לקנות כאן\":**\n  - \"אפשר\" for \"יחידות של קרן נאמנות\" and for \"קרן סל\".\n  - \"לא ידוע\" for foreign securities (\"ניירות ערך זרים\").\n  - No deposits, no savings plan, no bonds mentioned there.\n- **\"מה כתוב בפרסום, ומה במסמכים\".** Twice it says \"המסמך אומר אחרת\". For example, their advertising says \"פטור מעמלת ק/מ בקרנות כספיות\", but the papers say 0.07% with at least 2 ₪. That really bothered me. If what they advertise isn't what the papers say, how can I trust them?\n- **The end.** \"מינימום לפתיחת חשבון: 10,000.00 ₪\", supervised by \"רשות ניירות ערך\". I didn't open \"מה מגן על הכסף\", even though that's exactly what I wanted to know. I also didn't press the two buttons at the bottom.\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The long paragraph about Europe and Asia.\n- The small grey links (\"בתעריפון\", \"סעיף\", the dates).\n- The fold \"חשבון ניירות ערך · 2\".\n- I couldn't tell where this site comes from (\"מקור\"). Who wrote it? I don't know.\n\n**Words I didn't understand**\n- קרן סל, קרן כספית, מק\"מ, דמי משמרת, \"ק/מ\", HTML, \"לרבעון\" (as a charge), \"חבר בורסה\".\n- \"123 ממקור\"\n- What \"0.03% לרבעון\" would mean in shekels on 400,000 ₪.\n\n**Hard to read**\n- The whole page is black with grey letters. The grey writing and the small links were very hard to read, even with the page enlarged.\n\n**Where I got tired or worried**\n- At the money-changing part, written twice with two different numbers.\n- And at the \"המסמך אומר אחרת\" part, which is where I'd have stopped."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3692,"cache_read_input_tokens":7849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3692},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6043bf24-e4ab-4967-b83b-5b2e69aa4472","uuid":"59950be7-be89-4e61-8781-b911c7833a24","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:38:39.008Z","request_id":"req_011CgmgqYUynXBhMDFZGv1eJ"}
